    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dembigii Yeruusaalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Wiilka Aadamow, adigu ma doonaysaa inaad xukunto, ma doonaysaa inaad magaalada dhiigga qabta xukunto? Haddaba waa inaad iyada waxyaalaheeda karaahiyada ah oo dhan ogeysiisid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaad tahay magaalo dhexdeeda dhiig ku daadisa si uu wakhtigeedu u yimaado, oo sanamyo iyada u daran samaysa inay isku nijaasayso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad ku eedowday dhiiggii aad daadisay, oo waxaad ku nijaasowday sanamyadaadii aad samaysatay, oo wakhtigaagiina waad ka yeeshay inuu soo dhowaado, oo weliba cimrigaagiina wuu buuxsamay, oo sidaas daraaddeed cay baan quruumaha kaaga dhigay, oo majaajilo baan waddammada oo dhan kaaga dhigay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taada magaceedu ba'ay ee rabshadu ka buuxdaay, kuwa kuu dhow iyo kuwa kaa foguba way kugu majaajiloon doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, amiirrada reer binu Israa'iil ee ku dhex jooga midkood kastaaba wuxuu sidii xooggiisu ahaa ku talajiray inuu dhiig daadiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhexdaaday aabbe iyo hooyo ku fududaysteen, oo dhexdaaday shisheeyaha ku dulmeen, oo dhexdaaday agoonta iyo carmalka ku dhibeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxyaalahaygii quduuska ahaa waad quudhsatay, oo sabtiyadaydiina nijaas baad ka dhigtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa dhexdaada jooga niman xanta qaada si ay dhiig u daadiyaan, oo dhexdaada ayay buuraha wax ku cunaan, oo dhexdaada ayay shar ku sameeyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhexdaada ayay cawradii aabbahood ku soo bannaan dhigaan, oo dhexdaada ayay tan xaylka qabta ku ceebeeyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midba wuxuu karaahiyo la sameeyaa naagtii deriskiisa, oo mid kalena wuxuu si shar ah u nijaaseeyaa gabadha uu soddogga u yahay, oo mid kalena wuxuu dhexdaada ku kufsadaa walaashiis oo ah gabadhii aabbihiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhexdaada ayay laaluush ku qaataan si ay dhiig u daadiyaan aawadeed, oo waxaad qaadataa korsaar iyo ribo, oo si hunguri weyn iyo dulmi ah ayaad uga faa'iidaysataa deriskaaga, oo aniga waad i illowday, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bal eeg, anigu gacmahaygaan isugu dhuftaa faa'iidadaadii aad daacadla'aanta ku heshay, iyo dhiiggii lagugu dhex daadiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhtiga aan kula macaamiloon doono miyaa qalbigaagu u adkaysan karaa, miyaase gacmahaagu xoog u yeelan karaan? Aniga Rabbiga ah ayaa saas ku hadlay oo saas samayn doona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo quruumahaan kugu dhex eryi doonaa, oo waddammadaan kugu dhex firdhin doonaa, wasakhdaadana dhexdaada waan ka baabbi'in doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waad isku nijaasoobi doontaa iyadoo ay quruumahu indhaha ku hayaan, oo waxaad ogaan doontaa inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, reer binu Israa'iil wasakh bay ii noqdeen, oo kulligood waa naxaas iyo qasacad iyo bir iyo laxaamad foornada ku dhex jira, oo xataa waa wasakhda lacagta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaan idinku soo ururin doonaa Yeruusaalem gudaheeda, maxaa yeelay, kulligiin wasakh baad noqoteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sida lacag, iyo naxaas, iyo bir, iyo laxaamad, iyo qasacad loo soo ururiyo, oo foornada loogu dhex rido in dabka lagu afuufo si loo dhalaaliyo aawadeed, sidaas oo kalaan idinku soo wada ururin doonaa xanaaqayga iyo cadhadayda, oo halkaasaan idinku ridi doonaa oo aan idinku dhalaalin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hubaal waan idin soo ururin doonaa oo waxaan idinku soo afuufi doonaa dabka cadhadayda, oo idinkuna dhexdiisaad ku dhalaali doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sida lacagta foornada dhexdeeda loogu dhalaaliyo ayaad dhexdeeda ugu wada dhalaali doontaan, oo waxaad ogaan doontaan in aniga Rabbiga ahu aan cadhadaydii idinku kor shubay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, waxaad Yeruusaalem ku tidhaahdaa, Waxaad tahay dal aan la nadiifin oo aan maalinta dhirifka roob lagu soo kor dayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sirqool bay nebiyadeedu dhexdeeda ku sameeyeen, sidii libaax ciyaya oo xoog wax ku qabsada. Nafo dad ayay baabbi'iyeen, oo waxay iska qaataan khasnad iyo waxyaalo qaali ah, oo waxay u yeeleen carmallo badan oo dhexdeeda jooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadeediina sharcigaygii si xun bay u dhaafeen, oo waxay nijaaseeyeen waxyaalahaygii quduuska ahaa. Innaba ma ay kala duwin wixii quduuska ahaa iyo wixii nijaasta ahaa, oo innaba dadka ma ay barin inay kala gartaan wixii nadiifta ahaa iyo wixii aan nadiifta ahayn, oo indhahoodana waxay ka qariyeen sabtiyadaydii, oo anigana dhexdoodaa wax nijaas ah laygaga dhigay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiirradeeda dhex joogaa waa sida yeey xoog wax ku qabsata oo kale inay dhiig daadiyaan, iyo inay nafo dad halligaan, si ay faa'iido daacadla'aan ugu helaan aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo nebiyadeeduna waxay ku malaaseen dhoobo aan nuurad lahayn, oo iyagoo aan Rabbigu la hadlin ayay yidhaahdaan, Sayidka Rabbiga ah ayaa saas leh, illowse waxay arkeen wax aan waxba ahayn, oo wax been ah bay iyaga ugu faaliyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dadkii dalku waxay ku isticmaaleen dulmi, oo wax bay dheceen, oo masaakiintii iyo saboolkii baahnaa aad bay u dhibeen, oo xataa shisheeyihii si xun bay u dulmeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
