        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dhirifkaygaan ku soo shubay, oo dabkii cadhadayda ayaan ku baabbi'iyey, oo jidkoodiina madaxoodaan kaga abaal mariyey, ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay.",
